  Royce, Winston W. "Managing the Development of Large Software Systems: Concepts and Techniques." _Proceedings of IEEE WESCON_, 1970, 1–9. 这篇常被视为分阶段“瀑布”模型源头的经典论文，实际上论证了单次顺序走完各阶段远远不够，必须引入迭代与早期原型。

  Beck, Kent. "Embracing Change with Extreme Programming." _Computer_ 32, no. 10 (1999): 70–77. #link("https://doi.org/10.1109/2.796139"). 论证当变更在所难免时，工程纪律更应当用于保持变更的低成本，而非试图在前期杜绝变更。

  Beck, Kent, Mike Beedle, Arie van Bennekum, Alistair Cockburn, Ward Cunningham, Martin Fowler, James Grenning, Jim Highsmith, Andrew Hunt, Ron Jeffries, Jon Kern, Brian Marick, Robert C. Martin, Steve Mellor, Ken Schwaber, Jeff Sutherland, and Dave Thomas. "Manifesto for Agile Software Development." 2001. #link("https://agilemanifesto.org/"). 一份简短的价值观宣言，将一系列轻量级流程主张凝聚成了共同立场。

  Schwaber, Ken, and Jeff Sutherland. "The Scrum Guide: The Definitive Guide to Scrum: The Rules of the Game." 2020. #link("https://scrumguides.org/"). 以规范化的细节定义了一种广为采用的增量式工作安排，同时将绝大多数具体工程决策留给团队自行判断。

  Sommerville, Ian. _Software Engineering._ 10th ed. Boston, MA: Pearson, 2016. 对计划驱动与增量式两类流程模型进行了清晰的综述。

  Boehm, Barry, and Richard Turner. _Balancing Agility and Discipline: A Guide for the Perplexed._ Boston, MA: Addison-Wesley, 2003. 将前期纪律与后期适应之间的平衡框定为一项工程权衡。

  Winters, Titus, Tom Manshreck, and Hyrum Wright. _Software Engineering at Google: Lessons Learned from Programming Over Time._ Sebastopol, CA: O'Reilly Media, 2020. 将软件工程视为“在时间与变更维度上积分的编程”。
